    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "intake pods available",
      "description": "Ready intake pods. With one, deliveries still land; with none, they fail at nginx. Red **No data** means the metric stopped arriving more than 5 minutes ago: its collector, its node or the whole cluster is down.",
